{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17328","headline":"送清洨上人谒信州陆员外 · 权德舆","name":"送清洨上人谒信州陆员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"暂辞长老去随缘，候晓轻装寄客船。\n佳句已齐康宝月，清谈远指谢临川。\n滩经水濑逢新雪，路过渔潭宿暝烟。\n暇日若随千骑出，南岩只在郡楼前。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}